## 8. Step 4 — Rebuild, Sign, and Install the Patched APK

Rebuild the APK:

```bash
apktool b uncrackable3 -o UnCrackable-Level3-patched.apk
```

Sign it on Linux/macOS:

```bash
apksigner sign --ks ~/.android/debug.keystore UnCrackable-Level3-patched.apk
```

Sign it on Windows:

```cmd
apksigner sign --ks "%USERPROFILE%\.android\debug.keystore" UnCrackable-Level3-patched.apk
```

Default debug keystore password:

```text
android
```

Uninstall the original app if needed:

```bash
adb uninstall owasp.mstg.uncrackable3
```

Install the patched APK:

```bash
adb install -r UnCrackable-Level3-patched.apk
```

Expected result:

- The application opens normally.
- No root/tamper popup appears.
- You can enter text in the secret field.

At this point, the Java/smali protection is bypassed.

