## 19. Troubleshooting

### `INSTALL_FAILED_UPDATE_INCOMPATIBLE`

Uninstall the original app first:

```bash
adb uninstall owasp.mstg.uncrackable3
adb install UnCrackable-Level3-patched.apk
```

### `apksigner` cannot find the keystore

On Linux/macOS, use:

```bash
~/.android/debug.keystore
```

On Windows, use:

```cmd
%USERPROFILE%\.android\debug.keystore
```

### The app still crashes after patching smali

The crash may come from native anti-debug or anti-Frida checks. Patch the native initialization function in `libfoo.so` to return immediately.

### The native library patch does not work

Make sure you patched the correct ABI folder. Check the emulator ABI:

```bash
adb shell getprop ro.product.cpu.abi
```

Then replace the matching library in:

```text
uncrackable3/lib/<ABI>/libfoo.so
```

